              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "json-smart: Potential DoS via stack exhaustion (incomplete fix for CVE-2023-1370)"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "A security issue was found in Netplex Json-smart 2.5.0 through 2.5.1. When loading a specially crafted JSON input, containing a large number of ’{’, a stack exhaustion can be trigger, which could allow an attacker to cause a Denial of Service (DoS). This issue exists because of an incomplete fix for CVE-2023-1370."
